This directory shows how to create:
 * a qualifier that denotes that the representation of an object (such as a String, CharSequence, or byte[]) is encrypted, @Encrypted
 * a qualifier that denotes that the representation of an object may be unencrypted, @PossiblyUnencrypted

The Makefile shows how to invoke the Subtyping Checker to use the specialized annotations.

You can model your own new qualifiers and checkers after this example.

To see the demo, run: make demo
